version: 2.0.0
description: >-
  The Paradigm Cursor plugin: deterministic enforcement hooks, the MCP tools and
  compliance skills for Cursor. Cursor's marketplace does not take third-party
  plugins yet, so README.md documents the manual install.
components:
  cursor-plugin:
    description: >-
      Plugin layout. hooks/hooks.json maps Cursor hook events to the scripts.
      scripts/*.sh (scripts/paradigm-common.sh, scripts/paradigm-stop.sh,
      scripts/paradigm-pretooluse.sh and the rest) are COPIES generated from
      packages/paradigm/src/commands/hooks/scripts by
      packages/paradigm/scripts/generate-hooks.mjs; edit the sources there.
      skills/ holds the lore, preflight, postflight and scan skills.
    type: config
    files:
      - hooks/hooks.json
      - scripts/paradigm-common.sh
    components:
      - '#paradigm-hooks'
    tags: [plugin, cursor, hooks]
